--- !u!114 &1146660341
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1146660339}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8c03923c9ad8234f91bb06130798756, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TRLM.Runtime::TRLM.Dialogue.OpeningCinematicController
  cinematicCamera: {fileID: 476540201}
  islandSceneName: 20_Island_Blockout
  playOnStart: 1
  elias: {fileID: 0}
  mira: {fileID: 1335766331}
  jonah: {fileID: 337780602}
  lena: {fileID: 1991017687}
  noah: {fileID: 657138286}
  gearFocus: {fileID: 740225171}
  mapFocus: {fileID: 1874747193}
  boatFocus: {fileID: 1303596447}
  beats:
  - id: wide_establish
    cameraMarker: {fileID: 949208460}
    holdSeconds: 11
    lines:
    - id: s11_open_001
      speaker: 3
      turkishText: "Herkes burada m\u0131? Kameray\u0131 a\xE7mad\u0131m, s\xF6z."
      englishSubtitle: Everyone here? I swear the camera is off.
      emotion: 4
      delivery: quiet teasing
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: wide_establish
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 3.5333333
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_002
      speaker: 2
      turkishText: "Lena, kameray\u0131 saklad\u0131\u011F\u0131n y\xFCz\xFCnden
        belli oluyor."
      englishSubtitle: Lena, your hiding-the-camera face is terrible.
      emotion: 1
      delivery: dry joke
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: wide_establish
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 3.8666668
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
  - id: gear_load
    cameraMarker: {fileID: 112170458}
    holdSeconds: 13
    lines:
    - id: s11_open_003
      speaker: 4
      turkishText: "Rota k\u0131sa de\u011Fil. Fazla \xE7anta al\u0131rsak k\u0131y\u0131da
        kal\u0131r\u0131z."
      englishSubtitle: The route is not short. Too many bags and we lose time on
        the shore.
      emotion: 2
      delivery: practical
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: gear_load
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 5.3333335
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_004
      speaker: 0
      turkishText: "O zaman Mira'n\u0131n ta\u015F koleksiyonunu burada b\u0131rak\u0131yoruz."
      englishSubtitle: Then Mira's rock collection stays here.
      emotion: 4
      delivery: soft joke
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: gear_load
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 3.4
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_005
      speaker: 1
      turkishText: "Onlar \xF6rnek. Ve ikisi hayat\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 kurtarabilir."
      englishSubtitle: They are samples. And two of them might save our lives.
      emotion: 5
      delivery: matter-of-fact
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: gear_load
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 4.4666667
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
  - id: symbol_book
    cameraMarker: {fileID: 1314736656}
    holdSeconds: 14
    lines:
    - id: s11_open_006
      speaker: 1
      turkishText: "Bu i\u015Faret ayn\u0131 da\u011Fa \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor. Haritadaki
        eski patikayla \xF6rt\xFC\u015F\xFCyor."
      englishSubtitle: This symbol points to the same mountain. It lines up with
        the old trail on the map.
      emotion: 2
      delivery: low certainty
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: symbol_book
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 6.3333335
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_007
      speaker: 2
      turkishText: "Eski patikalar genelde bir sebepten eski kal\u0131r."
      englishSubtitle: Old trails usually stay old for a reason.
      emotion: 6
      delivery: protective
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: symbol_book
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 3.5333333
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
  - id: secrecy
    cameraMarker: {fileID: 949208460}
    holdSeconds: 13
    lines:
    - id: s11_open_008
      speaker: 0
      turkishText: "Kimseye s\xF6ylemedik. Telefonlar kapal\u0131. K\u0131y\u0131ya
        indik mi geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015F zor."
      englishSubtitle: We told no one. Phones off. Once we reach the shore, turning
        back gets hard.
      emotion: 6
      delivery: steady but honest
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: secrecy
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 5.866667
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_009
      speaker: 4
      turkishText: "Geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015F i\xE7in de\u011Fil, do\u011Fru d\xF6n\xFC\u015F
        i\xE7in haz\u0131rlan\u0131yoruz."
      englishSubtitle: We are not preparing to turn back. We are preparing to return
        right.
      emotion: 5
      delivery: calm guide
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: secrecy
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 5.3333335
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
  - id: friends
    cameraMarker: {fileID: 1314736656}
    holdSeconds: 12
    lines:
    - id: s11_open_010
      speaker: 3
      turkishText: "Elias bunu \xE7ocukken anlatt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda daha az yasad\u0131\u015F\u0131
        gelmi\u015Fti."
      englishSubtitle: When Elias told this story as a kid, it sounded less illegal.
      emotion: 1
      delivery: fond teasing
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: friends
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 4.866667
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_011
      speaker: 0
      turkishText: "\xC7ocukken daha iyi yalan s\xF6yl\xFCyordum."
      englishSubtitle: I was better at lying as a kid.
      emotion: 4
      delivery: small smile
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: friends
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 3
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
  - id: unease
    cameraMarker: {fileID: 112170458}
    holdSeconds: 14
    lines:
    - id: s11_open_012
      speaker: 1
      turkishText: "Efsane yanl\u0131\u015F olabilir. \u0130\u015Faretler yanl\u0131\u015F
        de\u011Fil."
      englishSubtitle: The legend may be wrong. The symbols are not.
      emotion: 2
      delivery: quiet conviction
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: unease
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 3.8
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_013
      speaker: 2
      turkishText: "Beni as\u0131l korkutan da bu."
      englishSubtitle: That is exactly what worries me.
      emotion: 3
      delivery: under breath
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: unease
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 3
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
  - id: departure
    cameraMarker: {fileID: 949208460}
    holdSeconds: 12
    lines:
    - id: s11_open_014
      speaker: 4
      turkishText: "Gelgit d\xF6nmeden \xE7\u0131karsak sabaha adaday\u0131z."
      englishSubtitle: If we leave before the tide turns, we reach the island by
        morning.
      emotion: 7
      delivery: route-aware
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: departure
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 5.2
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
    - id: s11_open_015
      speaker: 3
      turkishText: "Tamam. Kay\u0131tta de\u011Filim. Ama bunu unutmayaca\u011F\u0131m."
      englishSubtitle: Okay. I am not recording. But I am not forgetting this.
      emotion: 1
      delivery: soft
      scene: 05_Neighborhood_Cinematic
      trigger: departure
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      durationOverride: 4.4666667
      subtitlePriority: 30
      oneShot: 0
  sceneEndDelaySeconds: 1.5
